  MIRROR IDENTITY HOLDS FOR ALL 16: True
  Therefore Riv- = m(Riv+) = { p1 = 1, p2 + p3 >= 1, p3 > 0 }, and
     Riv+ cap Riv- = { (1, s, 1-s, 0) : 0 <= s < 1 }.
  On that segment p~ := (p1-1,p2-1,p3,p4) = (1-s)(0,-1,1,0), so Akin forces
  W_DC = W_CD against every co-player:
     q = 0000 [ALLD]                W_DC - W_CD = 0
     q = 0001 [q* (C only after DD)] W_DC - W_CD = 0
     q = 1111 [ALLC]                W_DC - W_CD = 0
     q = 0101 [ATFT]                W_DC - W_CD = 0

==============================================================================
FIXED eps (clause 9a): Riv+(eps) = {ALLD} exactly
==============================================================================
  From the exact ALLD identity above, w_DC - w_CD = -(1-2eps) sum_s w_s p_s with w > 0
  entrywise, so at any fixed eps in (0,1/2) it is >= 0 only for p = (0,0,0,0):
    p = ALLD       : 0
    p = generic p  : (2*epsilon - 1)*(epsilon**2*p1 - epsilon**2*p2 - epsilon**2*p3 + epsilon**2*p4 + epsilon*p2 + epsilon*p3 - 2*epsilon*p4 + p4)/(2*epsilon**2*p1 - 2*epsilon**2*p2 - 2*epsilon**2*p3 + 2*epsilon**2*p4 - epsilon*p1 + 3*epsilon*p2 + epsilon*p3 - 3*epsilon*p4 - p2 + p4 + 1)

[done in 48.6 s]
